Create a standalone printable QR code page as a file called `qr.html`.

## The QR code must point to this exact URL:
https://sapirbm511-ux.github.io/tau-impact.4.all

## Design requirements:
- Single HTML file, no external dependencies except QRCode.js from CDN
- Import QRCode.js: 
  <script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/qrcodejs/1.0.0/qrcode.min.js"></script>
- White background, centered content, A4 print-friendly
- Hebrew RTL text (font: Heebo from Google Fonts)
- Brand color: #673ab7 (purple)

## Page content (top to bottom):
1. Logo text: "TAU Social Impact 4 All" in brand purple, large and bold
2. QR code: 300×300px, colorDark="#673ab7", colorLight="#ffffff", 
   correctLevel=H
3. Instruction text: "סרקו לגילוי הזדמנויות מעורבות חברתית"
4. Event details:
   📅 יום שני, 29.6.2026
   🕐 11:00–14:30  
   📍 קמפוס אוניברסיטת תל אביב
5. The URL printed below in small text (direction: ltr):
   https://sapirbm511-ux.github.io/tau-impact.4.all
6. Print button: "🖨️ הדפסה" — styled in purple, calls window.print()

## QR code generation:
new QRCode(document.getElementById("qrcode"), {
  text: "https://sapirbm511-ux.github.io/tau-impact.4.all",
  width: 300,
  height: 300,
  colorDark: "#673ab7",
  colorLight: "#ffffff",
  correctLevel: QRCode.CorrectLevel.H
});

